source_evidence.quote:
This is much cleaner than the other hidden words. SCHRITT expands DY=SCHLUSS;
ARBEITSGANG paraphrases O=VORGANG; FUEHREN paraphrases L/CHD; EMPFAENGER comes
from a local owner. None of those needs a new component value.

The three-layer architecture matches f10r: picture owner, persistent registers,
visible card instructions. The process shape differs: f10r stays open and branches;
f11r closes a first extract and reopens a portion. No new card meanings are needed.
